#: src/components/project-map-form.tsx:86
msgid "Maps Jira project keys to the portal's projects — an issue's key is its Jira key prefix (ABC-123 → ABC); favorites pick their portal project themselves. Selected tasks are grouped by portal project and each group fills its own project + comment pair in the task form, largest group first (max {MAX_DISTINCT_PROJECTS} portal projects — the form has {MAX_DISTINCT_PROJECTS} pairs). Unmapped tasks fall back to the default project's group, or the first comment when no default project is set."
msgstr "Maps Jira project keys to the portal's projects — an issue's key is its Jira key prefix (ABC-123 → ABC); favorites pick their portal project themselves. Selected tasks are grouped by portal project and each group fills its own project + comment pair in the task form, largest group first (max {MAX_DISTINCT_PROJECTS} portal projects — the form has {MAX_DISTINCT_PROJECTS} pairs). Unmapped tasks fall back to the default project's group, or the first comment when no default project is set."

